// HZM coop - EXPLOSION POOL.
//
// The trilogy routes 366 explosion alias lines through about 34 distinct wavs. Explo_MetalMed1
// alone is the tank, truck, plane, jeep, glider, AA gun, bunker, door, K-5 railgun and radio.
// That single fact is why every explosion sounds like every other one, and no amount of alias
// juggling fixes it - the pool itself has to grow.
//
// Categories: close (dry, no tail) / grenade / large (with tail) / distant (off-map, the
// vocabulary MOHAA lacks entirely) / debris / sub (concussion bed) / bomb (heavy ordnance).
//
// Derivatives: downsampled to 22050 mono and re-normalised, not library files. The source
// library is licensed and deliberately unnamed here and everywhere else in the repo.
//
// Every line carries BOTH always and a maps list. always alone makes an alias RESOLVE on any
// map but does NOT precache - CacheResource is still gated by bLoadForMap - and a sound that
// registers lazily at first play arrives as a post-gamestate reliable command, which is the
// bug-1183 "server disconnected on spawn" failure. The token list is a PREFIX match, so
// "m e t dm obj lib train" covers the whole trilogy.


aliascache coop_ex_bomb_01          sound/coop_explosions/coop_ex_bomb_01.wav          soundparms 0.95 0.12 1.0 0.08  500 4200 auto loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
aliascache coop_ex_bomb_02          sound/coop_explosions/coop_ex_bomb_02.wav          soundparms 0.95 0.12 1.0 0.08  500 4200 auto loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
