// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// REPOINTING THE COOP-OWNED EXPLOSION ALIASES ONTO THE NEW POOL.
//
// These names are defined in ubersound.scr and are OURS - no retail script calls them - so
// repointing them changes only coop content. The override works on load order: G_RegisterSounds
// parses ubersound/*.scr alphabetically and Alias_ListAdd is FIRST-DEFINITION-WINS, and
// "coop_explosions.scr" sorts before "ubersound.scr". Same mechanism coop_pain.scr already uses
// to beat uberdialog.scr.
//
// Sound() resolves by PREFIX, so NN-numbered variants turn a single cue into a random pool with
// no call-site change. Two digits always - a one-digit "hit1" would also prefix-match "hit10".
//
// soundparms are copied from the originals (tuned against the maps) - only the file moves.
//
// DELIBERATELY NOT REPOINTED: coop_arty_incoming and coop_stuka_bomb are the incoming WHISTLE
// cues. None of the source libraries contains a shell whistle or a dive siren, so repointing
// them at a blast would lose the warning that makes them useful - they stay on retail audio
// until a real source exists. coop_snd_explosion is left alone too: it lives in
// coop_buildsounds.scr, which sorts BEFORE this file, so an override here could never win.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

aliascache mortar01                 sound/coop_explosions/coop_ex_large_03.wav         soundparms 1.0 0.25 0.95 0.25 1200 9000 auto loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
aliascache mortar02                 sound/coop_explosions/coop_ex_large_06.wav         soundparms 1.0 0.25 0.95 0.25 1200 9000 auto loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
aliascache mortar03                 sound/coop_explosions/coop_ex_large_08.wav         soundparms 1.0 0.25 0.95 0.25 1200 9000 auto loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
aliascache mortar04                 sound/coop_explosions/coop_ex_close_02.wav         soundparms 1.0 0.25 0.95 0.25 1200 9000 auto loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
aliascache mortar05                 sound/coop_explosions/coop_ex_sub_02.wav           soundparms 1.0 0.25 0.95 0.25 1200 9000 auto loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
aliascache mortar06                 sound/coop_explosions/coop_ex_debris_04.wav        soundparms 1.0 0.25 0.95 0.25 1200 9000 auto loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"

